OL,3,GNEWSANursery ordered to make 'urgent'  
OL,4,Aimprovement                            
OL,6,FThe watchdog gave four areas of        
OL,7,Fprovision the lowest "urgent           
OL,8,Fimprovement" grade while the remaining 
OL,9,Ftwo were rated as "needs attention". A 
OL,10,Fprevious inspection in May had rated   
OL,11,Fall six areas as needing attention.    
OL,13,FNursery director Roopali Gopal said    
OL,14,Fthey were "determined" to improve and a
OL,15,F"much stronger" staff training         
OL,16,Fprogramme had been put in place.       
